{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Modelin skorlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131lar; `bucket` ile d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck/orta/y\u00fcksek olas\u0131l\u0131k grubu se\u00e7ilir. Devam\u0131 i\u00e7in `next_cursor`. Gerekli kapsam: users:read.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"app_id":{"description":"App kimli\u011fi (app_\u2026). App\u2019e ba\u011fl\u0131 anahtarda veya varsay\u0131lan app tan\u0131ml\u0131ysa gerekmez.","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!\\.{1,2}$)[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]+$","type":"string"},"bucket":{"enum":["low","medium","high"],"type":"string"},"cursor":{"description":"\u00d6nceki yan\u0131ttaki `next_cursor` de\u011feri.","maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Sayfa boyutu (varsay\u0131lan 20).","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"prediction_id":{"description":"\u00d6ng\u00f6r\u00fc modeli kimli\u011fi","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!\\.{1,2}$)[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]+$","type":"string"}},"required":["prediction_id"],"type":"object"},"name":"list_prediction_users","title":"\u00d6ng\u00f6r\u00fc skoruna g\u00f6re kullan\u0131c\u0131lar"}
